WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:04.430
My little brother never tells the truth.

00:04.550 --> 00:08.440
That tells us. But can we picture it?

00:08.560 --> 00:13.960
An allusion points to a famous story your reader already knows.

00:14.080 --> 00:17.720
My little brother is a real Pinocchio.

00:17.840 --> 00:20.840
Now we can see his nose grow!

00:20.960 --> 00:27.360
Here is one more. On Saturdays my sister turns into Sleeping Beauty.

00:27.480 --> 00:34.183
So look for a name from a story everyone knows, and try one in your own writing!
